  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the following works: T2 (Cherry) - fell to ground level and replace.\r\n\r\nInsufficient evidence has been provided to demonstrate that removal of the tree is necessary. Whilst signs of bacterial canker are present, no supporting information has been submitted to confirm that the tree is in poor structural condition or that felling is justified. T2 makes a positive contribution to the visual amenity of the local area due to its prominent position adjacent to the A1008 and Addison Road. The loss of the tree would have an adverse impact on the character and appearance of the area, and the submitted information does not outweigh the amenity value of the tree."
